---
import Icon from "./Icon.astro";
import { CONTACT_HREF, SITE } from "../consts";

/*
 * FORM SEAM - read before replacing the mailto.
 *
 * Today this is a mailto, on purpose: there is no signup, no demo environment,
 * and no backend for this site, and a contact form that posts nowhere loses
 * whatever somebody took the trouble to type.
 *
 * When there is somewhere for it to go, the house pattern in this organization
 * is Formspree (`@formspree/react` is already in use on the main Sidereal
 * site). Swapping it in here means:
 *
 *   1. Create the form in Formspree and take its endpoint id. Do NOT invent
 *      one; a wrong id fails silently, which is the exact failure this seam
 *      exists to avoid.
 *   2. Either post a plain <form action="https://formspree.io/f/<id>"
 *      method="POST"> - which needs no JavaScript at all and is the better fit
 *      for this site - or, if inline validation is wanted, add @astrojs/react
 *      plus @formspree/react and mount a single island with client:visible.
 *      Nothing else on this site is hydrated, so that island would be the
 *      first JavaScript the page ships. It should earn it.
 *   3. Keep the mailto visible underneath either way. Some of the people this
 *      product is for are on a phone in a barn with one bar of signal, and a
 *      form submission that fails there should not be the end of the road.
 *   4. Label every field, keep the honeypot server-side rather than as a
 *      hidden input that a screen reader will read out, and keep the success
 *      state on the page rather than on a redirect.
 */
---

<section
  id="contact"
  class="on-ink scroll-mt-20 bg-ink px-5 py-20 text-ink-foreground sm:px-8 sm:py-24 lg:py-32"
>
  <div class="mx-auto max-w-3xl text-center">
    <p class="eyebrow">Get in touch</p>
    <div class="rule-center mx-auto mt-3 mb-7 w-24"></div>

    <h2 class="text-3xl text-balance sm:text-4xl">Tell us about your facility.</h2>

    <p class="mx-auto mt-6 max-w-2xl text-lg text-pretty text-ink-muted">
      There is no self-serve signup yet and no demo environment to click through. Write to us with
      what you keep records in today and roughly how many animals are in your care, and we will tell
      you whether ARK is ready to be useful to you.
    </p>

    <div class="mt-10 flex justify-center">
      <a
        href={CONTACT_HREF}
        class="inline-flex items-center gap-2.5 rounded-xl bg-ink-foreground px-7 py-4 text-lg font-semibold text-ink shadow-lg transition-[transform,box-shadow] hover:shadow-xl active:translate-y-px"
      >
        {SITE.contactEmail}
        <Icon name="arrow-right" class="size-5" />
      </a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
